
DestinationRule/reviews -n bookinfo, created 1m ago, gen:2
  Current: Resource is current
  Host: Service/reviews
  mTLS: ISTIO_MUTUAL
  Load balancing: LEAST_REQUEST
  Connection pool: maxConnections=100, connectTimeout=30ms, http1MaxPendingRequests=1024, http2MaxRequests=1000, maxRequestsPerConnection=10, maxRetries=3, idleTimeout=1h
  Outlier detection: eject on 5 consecutive 5xx, checked every 10s, for 30s, up to 100% of the pool
  Subsets:
    v1 version=v1
    v2 version=v2
      Load balancing: consistent hash on header x-user
    v3 version=v3

DestinationRule/legacy-ratings -n bookinfo, created 1m ago, gen:1
  Current: Resource is current
  Exported to: bookinfo, istio-system
  Host: Service/ratings
  Applies only to workloads: app=ratings
  mTLS: SIMPLE, sni ratings.internal
  Connection pool: maxConnections=1
  Outlier detection: eject on 1 consecutive 5xx, checked every 1s, for 15m, up to 100% of the pool
  Port 9080:
    mTLS: DISABLE

DestinationRule/external-api -n bookinfo, created 1m ago, gen:1
  Current: Resource is current
  Host: api.example.com
  mTLS: SIMPLE, insecureSkipVerify
  Load balancing: ROUND_ROBIN, locality-aware
